  "description": "The GoLine Foldable Electric Scooter is a compact and practical choice for commuting, short trips, and everyday city travel. Powered by a 250W brushless motor, it reaches speeds of up to 17 mph and offers a riding range of up to 12 miles per charge. Its 36V lithium battery recharges in approximately five to six hours, making it convenient for daily use.\nBuilt with a durable aluminum-alloy frame, the GoLine folds easily for storage or transport. It features four speed levels, a responsive disc brake, an LED display, integrated turn signals, a front headlight, a rear light, and a horn for added convenience and safety. Front and rear fenders and IPX4 water resistance provide additional protection during everyday outdoor use. With easy throttle operation and a sleek black design, the GoLine delivers a smooth, convenient, and reliable riding experience.\n.\n\n17mphTop Speed\n\nUp to 12 miles Range\n\n250 W Hub Motor\n\n36V5.2 Ah",
